  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 22, 2026 at 05:57 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/curebay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CureBay</a>, a <a href=\"/tag/health-tech+platform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">health-tech platform</a> focused on rural India, has raised Rs 100 crore in a Pre-Series C round, led by <a href=\"/tag/ivycap+ventures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IvyCap Ventures</a>. The round comprises Rs 69 crore in equity led by IvyCap Ventures along with other existing investors, and over Rs 30 crore in debt from Trifecta Capital, Alteria Capital and VentureSoul Partners. CureBay said this round will provide the necessary support to further expand its presence across India, including into new markets such as Andhra Pradesh. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“It will also deepen the company’s proprietary technology and AI capabilities, including its Intelligence Layer, to strengthen screening, health insights, and clinical decision-making across the care journey,” the health-tech platform added.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Launched in 2021, CureBay has built a six-layer integrated <a href=\"/tag/rural+healthcare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">rural healthcare</a> operating system spanning IoT-enabled Clinics, a Swasthya Mitra network, a connected digital platform, AI-powered screening and risk alerts, a 24/7 command centre, and CureBay Kavach. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>According to the firm, this operating system is deployed through more than 250 technology-enabled Clinics across seven states, supported by over 1,800 Swasthya Mitras, and more than 530 trained clinical staff, 230  doctor partners, 210 partner hospitals and laboratories. It has served over 17 lakh patients and conducts over 400 health camps every month, CureBay added.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 22, 2026 at 05:57 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 22, 2026 at 05:57 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                  